## 4. Usage Example (Controller or Test)

```java
PageResult<Employee> page = employeeService.getEmployeesByDepartment("SALES", 2, 10);

System.out.println("Page: " + page.getPageNumber() + "/" + page.getTotalPages());
System.out.println("Total records: " + page.getTotalRows());
System.out.println("Is last page? " + page.isLastPage());

page.getContent().forEach(System.out::println);
```

